---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#10264d"/><title>Excel Roofing | Flat roofing since 1989</title><meta name="description" content="Excel Roofing. Flat roofing, repairs and rooflights in Lichfield and Staffordshire. Established in 1989. Discuss your roof and request a quote."/><link rel="icon" href="/images/logo.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/hero.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"/>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div id="intro" class="intro" hidden><div class="intro-logo"><img src="/images/logo.svg" alt="" width="240" height="172"/></div><span class="intro-caption">CRAFT & CONFIDENCE · SINCE 1989</span><button id="skip-intro" tabindex="-1">Skip intro</button></div>
<header class="header"><a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="Excel Roofing home"><img id="header-logo" src="/images/logo.svg" alt="Excel Roofing — Flat Roofing Specialist" width="170" height="122"/></a><span class="est">Established 1989</span><button class="menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navigation">Menu <span>＋</span></button><nav id="navigation" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#work">Our work</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a><a class="button button-navy" href="#contact">Request a quote</a></nav></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading"><img class="hero-image" src="/images/hero.jpg" alt="Completed flat roof on a brick home extension" width="1478" height="1064" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="hero-content"><p class="eyebrow">LICHFIELD & STAFFORDSHIRE</p><h1 id="hero-heading">Flat roofing.<br/><span>Since 1989.</span></h1><p class="hero-copy">Expertise above.<br/>Peace of mind below.</p><p class="hero-description">Flat roof repairs, replacements and rooflights.<br class="desktop-break"/> Care and experience, from the first conversation.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-blue" href="#contact">Request a quote</a><a class="text-link" href="#work">View our work</a></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>LOCAL KNOWLEDGE. LASTING CRAFT.</span><a href="#services" aria-label="Scroll to our services">Scroll to discover</a></div><button class="motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause background motion">Pause</button></section>
<div class="service-strip"><a href="#flat-roofing">Flat roofing</a><a href="#repairs">Roof repairs</a><a href="#rooflights">Rooflights</a></div>
<section class="about section" id="about"><div class="about-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE THAT SHOWS</p><h2>Established locally.<br/>Built on experience.</h2><p class="lead">Looking after local roofs since 1989.</p><p>From a small repair to a replacement flat roof, we take the time to understand what your home needs. Clear conversations, considered advice and attention to the details that matter.</p><a class="text-link dark" href="#contact">Talk to us about your roof</a><div class="signature"><span class="year">1989</span><span>Our story started here.<br/>Our work continues above you.</span></div></div><figure class="about-image reveal"><img src="/images/rooflight.jpg" alt="Rooflight with carefully finished edging on a flat roof" width="1100" height="792" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>THE FINISH IS IN THE DETAIL <span>01 / EXCEL ROOFING</span></figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="services section" id="services"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE DO</p><h2>Good roofs.<br/>Thought through.</h2></div><p>Practical solutions for the roof you have<br class="desktop-break"/> and the home you want to protect.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><article class="service-card reveal" id="flat-roofing"><span class="number">01</span><svg viewBox="0 0 64 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 20 32 8l26 12-26 12L6 20Zm0 8 26 12 26-12M6 36l26 12 26-12"/></svg><h3>Flat roofing</h3><p>New flat roofs and replacements for extensions, garages and the spaces that make your house a home.</p><a href="#contact" class="text-link dark" data-service="Flat roofing">Discuss your project</a></article><article class="service-card reveal" id="repairs"><span class="number">02</span><svg viewBox="0 0 64 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 24 26-18 26 18M14 20v25h36V20M28 23l-5 10h11l-5 10"/></svg><h3>Roof repairs</h3><p>A leak, worn finish or an area of concern? We’ll help you understand the problem and the next step.</p><a href="#contact" class="text-link dark" data-service="Roof repairs">Tell us what’s wrong</a></article><article class="service-card reveal" id="rooflights"><span class="number">03</span><svg viewBox="0 0 64 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 32 22-18 28 11-21 19L7 32Zm0 0v6l29 10 21-17v-6M31 3v6M49 7l-5 6M58 14l-7 4"/></svg><h3>Rooflights</h3><p>Bring natural light into the room below, with rooflights that sit neatly within your flat roof.</p><a href="#contact" class="text-link dark" data-service="Rooflights">Let’s talk rooflights</a></article></div></section>
<section class="work section" id="work"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">A CLOSER LOOK</p><h2>Our work.<br/>Out in the open.</h2></div><p>A selection of Excel Roofing projects.<br/>Take a look at the finish.</p></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.map((p,i)=><button class={`project reveal project-${i}`} data-image={`/images/${p.image}.jpg`} data-caption={p.title} aria-label={`View project: ${p.title}`}><div class="project-image"><img src={`/images/${p.image}.jpg`} alt={p.detail} width="1100" height="792" loading="lazy"/><span class="project-open" aria-hidden="true">View project</span></div><span class="project-caption"><span><strong>{p.title}</strong><small>{p.detail}</small></span><span class="project-index">0{i+1}</span></span></button>)}</div></section>
<section class="process section"><div class="process-title reveal"><p class="eyebrow">FROM FIRST CALL TO FINAL DETAIL</p><h2>Let’s keep<br/>it straightforward.</h2></div><ol><li class="reveal"><span>01</span><div><h3>Tell us about your roof</h3><p>Give us a call or send a few details about the work you have in mind.</p></div></li><li class="reveal"><span>02</span><div><h3>Understand your options</h3><p>We’ll discuss your roof, arrange a look where needed and talk through the work.</p></div></li><li class="reveal"><span>03</span><div><h3>A clear way forward</h3><p>Agree the scope and quote before arranging the next steps together.</p></div></li></ol></section>
<section class="contact section" id="contact"><div class="contact-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow">START WITH A CONVERSATION</p><h2>What does<br/>your roof need?</h2><p>Tell us a little about your project.<br/>We’ll take it from there.</p><a class="phone" href="tel:01543433289">01543 433289</a><a class="mobile" href="tel:07973673255">Or call 07973 673255</a><a class="text-link" href="https://wa.me/447973673255" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Message on WhatsApp</a><p class="area">BASED LOCALLY · LICHFIELD & STAFFORDSHIRE</p></div><form name="roof-enquiry" method="POST" action="/thank-you" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company-website" class="quote-form reveal"><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="roof-enquiry"/><p hidden><label>Leave this empty <input name="company-website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></p><div class="form-heading"><h3>Request a quote</h3></div><div class="form-row"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="Full name"/></label><label>Phone number<input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required placeholder="Your contact number"/></label></div><label>Email address <span class="optional">(optional)</span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com"/></label><div class="form-row"><label>Postcode<input name="postcode" autocomplete="postal-code" required placeholder="e.g. WS13"/></label><label>How can we help?<select name="service" id="service"><option>Flat roofing</option><option>Roof repairs</option><option>Rooflights</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></label></div><label>A little about your roof<textarea name="message" rows="3" required placeholder="Tell us about the problem or project…"></textarea></label><p class="form-note">Your details will only be used to respond to your enquiry. <a href="/privacy">Privacy information</a>.</p><button class="button button-blue submit" type="submit">Send your enquiry</button><p id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="footer-main"><a href="#" aria-label="Back to top"><img src="/images/logo.svg" alt="Excel Roofing" width="175" height="126" loading="lazy"/></a><p>Flat roofing.<br/><strong>Since 1989.</strong></p><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#work">Our work</a><a href="#contact">Get in touch</a></nav></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Excel Roofing Ltd.</span><span>Lichfield & Staffordshire</span><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></div></footer>
<dialog id="gallery"><button class="gallery-close" aria-label="Close project photograph">Close ×</button><img alt=""/><p></p></dialog>
<script src="../scripts/site.js"></script>
</body></html>
